cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AMC-Drive: Learning Redundancy-Aware Effective Multimodality for End-to-End Autonomous Driving"
message: "If you use AMC-Drive, please cite this repository and the upstream Drive-JEPA and NAVSIM papers."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Yongzhi
repository-code: "https://github.com/lumen2023/AMC-Drive"
abstract: "AMC-Drive is a Drive-JEPA-lineage proposal-based driving planner that calibrates fixed-budget proposal organization in consequence space while preserving the deployable K=32 NAVSIM interface."
keywords:
  - autonomous driving
  - multimodal planning
  - effective multimodality
  - NAVSIM
  - Drive-JEPA
license: "Apache-2.0"
